PROVINCE OF SOUTH SUMATRA
REGIONAL REGULATION OF MUARA ENIM REGENCY
NUMBER 5 YEAR 2023
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF MUARA ENIM,

Considering:
a. that to guarantee the Protection of Women and Children in accordance with their dignity and to guarantee their right to life in accordance with their nature and destiny without discrimination and to receive Protection from violence and other violations, legal certainty is necessary;
b. that to provide legal certainty in the implementation of Protection of Women and Children and to carry out mandatory regional government affairs, regulation in the form of a Regional Regulation is necessary;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children;

In view of:
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 28 Year 1959 concerning the Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 3 Year 1950 concerning the Establishment of Level I Region of South Sumatra and Emergency Law Number 16 Year 1955 concerning Amendment to Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 3 Year 1950 (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1959 Number 70, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1814);
(2)
3. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on The Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 3277);
4. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
5. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 17 Year 2016 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 1 Year 2016 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection into Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2016 Number 99, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5882);
6. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
7. Law Number 11 Year 2012 concerning Juvenile Criminal Justice System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2012 Number 153, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5332);
8. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as has been amended several times, most recently by Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 Year 2022 concerning Job Creation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2022 Number 238, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6841);
(3)
9. Government Regulation Number 78 Year 2021 concerning Special Protection for Children (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2021 Number 174, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6704);
10. Regulation of the State Minister for Women Empowerment and Child Protection Number 11 Year 2011 concerning Policy for Development of Child-Friendly Regency/City;
11. Regional Regulation Number 14 Year 2014 concerning Free Legal Aid (Regional Gazette of Muara Enim Regency Year 2014 Number 014);
12. Regional Regulation Number 9 Year 2020 concerning Implementation of Child-Friendly Regency (Regional Gazette Year 2020 Number 9);
13. Regional Regulation of Muara Enim Regency Number 2 Year 2022 concerning Gender Mainstreaming (Regional Gazette of Muara Enim Regency Year 2021 Number 2);

With Mutual Approval of
